					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605861457" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;" >DarkStuff</a></span> <span class="odate time_1495643937 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">24 May 2017 16:38</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2831316">
									

<p>Alright, this is my third skip. Hopefully. Hopefully it works. What was I going for here? Well, originally I had it as an army of woodboring beetles that were destroying a forest god, but that didn't work. Then I focused on making the bugs cuter while having the forest god in the background. In the end, I found out I just liked the bugs, so I removed the forest god altogether. And then I thought, but what do they do? After I figured out their &quot;gimmick&quot;, I realised I didn't have to have them be sapient anymore, so I've left it debatable. I hope I have a good layer of mystery here.</p>
<p>EDIT: <em>Made some last minute revisions, and there is now an addendum that I am proud of. Tell me what y'all think.</em><br />
EDIT 2: <em>Yay for +40! Is this a big landmark? No! But it's been at +39 for what has felt like for</em>ever<em>! So I am glad to not stare at that 9. Taunting me. Thank you, for +40.</em><br />
EDIT 3: <em>Actually justified yay for +50! Yayy!</em></p>
